CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (BVH conversion by Bruce Hahne / cgspeed, mirror: https://github.com/una-dinosauria/cmu-mocap)
Licence URL: http://mocap.cs.cmu.edu/  (FAQ: http://mocap.cs.cmu.edu/faqs.php; not reachable from the cloud container, text taken from the mirror's READMEFIRST.txt which quotes it)

CMU places no restrictions on the use of the original dataset, and I (Bruce) place no
additional restrictions on the use of this particular BVH conversion.

  Use this data!  This data is free for use in research and commercial
  projects worldwide.  If you publish results obtained using this data,
  we would appreciate it if you would send the citation to your
  published paper to jkh+mocap@cs.cmu.edu, and also would add this text
  to your acknowledgments section: "The data used in this project was
  obtained from mocap.cs.cmu.edu.  The database was created with funding
  from NSF EIA-0196217."

Credit line used in the game (kingdom/CREDITS.md): "Motion capture data from the CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture
Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu), created with funding from NSF EIA-0196217."
Do not resell the raw data: the raw BVH files in _raw/ are git-ignored (see _raw/.gitignore); only retargeted clips ship.
